# thoughts files, PLAN/OUTLINE, span-carve report + tool, the 54 fanout group verdicts
# and their input lists, ref/ copies, the two rehydration BRIEFs, the Strand-3 reading
# list). Moved here 2026-08-12 from ~/src/AISI-responses (formerly ~/src/system-prompts),
# whose local-only git history holds the whole evolution.
#
# Untracked because this repo is public and the working record still carries what the
# two committed documents beside it had scrubbed out: personal and family detail, one
# minor's name, cohort-as-family framing, and file:line maps into private vaults and
# ~/.claude transcripts. Same distinction as the entry above — publication, not validity.
# Directory entry rather than bare filenames: the record is only legible as a tree.
INGEST/stopgap-drafting-2026-08-11/
